#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:1
msgid "KPP Architecture Overview"
msgstr "KPP 架构概览"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:3
msgid ""
"This page explains how KPP's model components fit together and how different"
" model families (RBM, DBN, Q-VAE, Q-Diffusion) build on top of each other. "
"For the high-level system architecture and component interaction diagram, "
"see the [Introduction](../introduction.md)."
msgstr ""
"本页面解释 KPP "
"的模型组件如何组合在一起，以及不同模型家族（RBM、DBN、Q-VAE、Q-Diffusion）如何构建在彼此之上。有关高层系统架构和组件交互图，请参见[简介](../introduction.md)。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:5
msgid "Design Philosophy"
msgstr "设计理念"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:7
msgid "KPP is built on two core principles:"
msgstr "KPP 建立在两个核心原则之上："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:9
msgid ""
"**Decoupled architecture**: energy model definition is separated from "
"sampling execution. You can swap samplers (SA ↔ CIM) without changing the "
"model code."
msgstr "**解耦架构**：能量模型定义与采样执行分离。您可以在不修改模型代码的情况下切换采样器（SA ↔ CIM）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:10
msgid ""
"**Composition over inheritance**: base energy models (RBM/BM) are combined "
"with user-provided components (encoder, decoder) to build application-"
"specific models."
msgstr "**组合优于继承**：基础能量模型（RBM/BM）与用户提供的组件（编码器、解码器）组合，构建特定应用的模型。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:12
msgid ""
"This means you can start with a simple RBM for feature extraction, then "
"extend it into a DBN for deeper representations, or wrap it in a Q-VAE "
"framework for generative modeling — all within the same PyTorch workflow."
msgstr ""
"这意味着您可以从简单的 RBM 开始进行特征提取，然后将其扩展为 DBN 以获得更深层次的表示，或者将其封装在 Q-VAE "
"框架中进行生成建模——所有这些都在同一个 PyTorch 工作流中完成。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:16
msgid "Model Families"
msgstr "模型家族"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:18
msgid ""
"Right now, KPP provides four main model families, each building on the "
"previous one."
msgstr "目前，KPP 提供四个主要模型家族，每个都建立在前一个之上："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:20
msgid ""
"📖 **Complete API reference**: See the full [Module "
"API](../../modules/kaiwu.torch_plugin.md) for all classes, methods, and "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"📖 **完整 API 参考**：完整的[模块 "
"API](../../modules/kaiwu.torch_plugin.md)涵盖了所有类、方法和参数。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:22
msgid "1. Boltzmann Machine (BM)"
msgstr "1\\. 玻尔兹曼机（BM）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:24
msgid ""
"**The foundation**: an energy-based model family with visible and hidden "
"units, binary by default, with a Gaussian-Bernoulli variant that models one "
"side as Gaussian for real-valued inputs."
msgstr "**基础**：一个基于能量的模型家族，包含可见单元与隐藏单元，默认采用二值单元；另有高斯-伯努利变体，将一侧建模为高斯分布以处理实值输入。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:26
msgid ""
"**Full Boltzmann Machine**: fully connected graph, all units can connect to "
"each other. Requires sequential sampling."
msgstr "**全连接玻尔兹曼机**：全连接图——所有单元都可以相互连接。需要顺序采样。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:27
msgid ""
"**Restricted Boltzmann Machine (RBM)**: bipartite graph, visible units only "
"connect to hidden units, no visible-visible or hidden-hidden connections. "
"This enables parallel sampling within layers."
msgstr "**受限玻尔兹曼机（RBM）**：二部图——可见单元仅连接到隐藏单元，没有可见-可见或隐藏-隐藏连接。这使得层内并行采样成为可能。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:28
msgid ""
"**Gaussian-Bernoulli RBM (GBRBM)**: extends RBM to continuous-valued inputs,"
" one partition is Gaussian (with learned mean/variance) and the other stays "
"Bernoulli; `is_visible_gaussian` picks which side is Gaussian (default: "
"visible)."
msgstr ""
"**高斯-伯努利受限玻尔兹曼机（GBRBM）**：将 RBM "
"扩展到连续值输入，一侧为高斯分布（均值/方差可学习），另一侧保持伯努利分布；`is_visible_gaussian` "
"决定哪一侧为高斯分布（默认为可见层）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:30
msgid ""
"**Main classes**: `BoltzmannMachine`, `RestrictedBoltzmannMachine`, "
"`GaussianBernoulliRestrictedBoltzmannMachine`"
msgstr ""
"**主要类**：`BoltzmannMachine`、`RestrictedBoltzmannMachine`、`GaussianBernoulliRestrictedBoltzmannMachine`"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:32
msgid "**Typical use**: unsupervised feature learning, generative modeling."
msgstr "**典型用途**：无监督特征学习、生成建模。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:34
msgid ""
"→ Hands-on: [RBM Classification](rbm_classification.md), [BM "
"Generation](bm_generation.md), GBRBM (Coming Soon)"
msgstr ""
"→ 实战教程：[RBM 分类](rbm_classification.md)、[BM 生成](bm_generation.md)、GBRBM（即将推出）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:38
msgid "2. Deep Belief Network (DBN)"
msgstr "2\\. 深度置信网络（DBN）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:40
msgid "**Extension**: stack multiple RBMs into a deep network."
msgstr "**扩展**：将多个 RBM 堆叠成深度网络。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:42
msgid ""
"Each RBM is trained greedily layer-by-layer (unsupervised), then the whole "
"stack can be fine-tuned (supervised)."
msgstr "每个 RBM 逐层贪婪训练（无监督），然后整个网络栈可以进行微调（有监督）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:54
msgid "**Main class**: `UnsupervisedDBN`"
msgstr "**主要类**：`UnsupervisedDBN`"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:56
msgid "**Typical use**: hierarchical feature learning, deep representations."
msgstr "**典型用途**：层次化特征学习、深度表示。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:58
msgid "→ Hands-on: [DBN Classification](dbn_classification.md)"
msgstr "→ 实战教程：[DBN 分类](dbn_classification.md)"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:62
msgid "3. Quantum Variational Autoencoder (Q-VAE)"
msgstr "3\\. 量子变分自编码器（Q-VAE）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:64
msgid ""
"**Extension**: combine an encoder-decoder architecture with a QBM prior."
msgstr "**扩展**：将编码器-解码器架构与 QBM 先验结合。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:66
msgid ""
"Instead of the standard Gaussian prior in a VAE, Q-VAE uses a **quantum "
"Boltzmann machine (QBM)**, a Boltzmann machine whose negative-phase sampling"
" is handled by the SA/CIM sampler, as the latent prior."
msgstr ""
"Q-VAE 不使用 VAE 中的标准高斯先验，而是使用**量子玻尔兹曼机（QBM）**——一种负相采样由 SA/CIM "
"采样器处理的玻尔兹曼机——作为隐变量先验。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:72
msgid "**Components**:"
msgstr "**组件**："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:73
msgid "Encoder: maps input to a latent distribution"
msgstr "编码器：将输入映射到隐分布"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:74
msgid "Decoder: reconstructs input from latent samples"
msgstr "解码器：从隐变量样本重构输入"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:75
msgid "QBM prior: a Boltzmann machine prior sampled by SA or CIM"
msgstr "QBM 先验：由 SA 或 CIM 采样的玻尔兹曼机先验"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:76
msgid "Sampler: SA (classical) or CIM (quantum)"
msgstr "采样器：SA（经典）或 CIM（量子）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:78
msgid "**Main classes**: `QVAE`, `AutoEncoderBase`"
msgstr "**主要类**：`QVAE`, `AutoEncoderBase`"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:80
msgid ""
"**Typical use**: generative modeling, representation learning, anomaly "
"detection."
msgstr "**典型用途**：生成建模、表示学习、异常检测。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:82
msgid "**Application variants** (in `example/`):"
msgstr "**应用变体**（在 `example/` 中）："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:83
msgid "`MNISTQVAE`: image generation (784-d input)"
msgstr "`MNISTQVAE` — 图像生成（784 维输入）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:84
msgid ""
"`CellQVAE`: single-cell transcriptomics (10k+ genes, batch-conditioned)"
msgstr "`CellQVAE` — 单细胞转录组学（10k+ 基因，批次条件化）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:85
msgid "`CleanEnergyQVAE`: anomaly detection (free-energy scoring head)"
msgstr "`CleanEnergyQVAE` — 异常检测（自由能量评分头）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:87
msgid ""
"→ Hands-on: [Q-VAE MNIST](qvae_mnist.md), [Q-VAE Cell](qvae_cell.md), [Q-VAE"
" Anomaly](qvae_anomaly.md)"
msgstr ""
"→ 实战教程：[Q-VAE MNIST](qvae_mnist.md)、[Q-VAE Cell](qvae_cell.md)、[Q-VAE "
"Anomaly](qvae_anomaly.md)"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:91
msgid "4. Q-Diffusion"
msgstr "4\\. Q-Diffusion"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:93
msgid "**Extension**: discrete diffusion model with a BM energy reranker."
msgstr "**扩展**：具有 BM 能量重排序器的离散扩散模型。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:95
msgid ""
"Combines a pre-trained protein language model (DPLM) as the proposal model "
"with a trainable BM energy reranker to improve generated sequence quality."
msgstr "将预训练的蛋白质语言模型（DPLM）作为提议模型，与可训练的 BM 能量重排序器结合，以提高生成序列的质量。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:105
msgid "**Main classes**: `QDiffusion`, `QDiffusionConfig`"
msgstr "**主要类**：`QDiffusion`, `QDiffusionConfig`"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:107
msgid "**Typical use**: protein sequence generation, energy-guided sampling."
msgstr "**典型用途**：蛋白质序列生成、能量引导采样。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/architecture_overview.md:109
msgid "→ Hands-on: [Q-Diffusion](qdiffusion.md)"
msgstr "→ 实战教程：[Q-Diffusion](qdiffusion.md)"

